   "kind": "Finding",
   "url": "findings/finding-01.html",
   "text": "36,106 of 56,258 records — 64.2% — have no recorded LastInspDate. A documentation and timeline-traceability finding. A claim that 64.2% of records were never inspected. Before 2025, this field was not functioning as a true historical inspection-date field. It was used for point/geospatial data or left blank.",
